cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Dense-Armor: Robot-AI Online Shielding & Learning"
abstract: >-
  A library for online learning on robot, vision, and AI streams, one sample
  at a time, with streaming statistics and protection, drift and anomaly
  detection, and safe robot commands.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Pennacchio
    given-names: Salvatore
    email: jtatopenn@libero.it
repository-code: "https://github.com/tatopenn-cell/Dense-Armor"
url: "https://tatopenn-cell.github.io/Dense-Armor/"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
version: "1.5.0"
date-released: "2026-11-07"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24030156"
keywords:

